Documentation -
website/navigation/creating-a-breadcrumb-navigation">http://docs.shopify.com/support/your-website/navigation/creating-a-breadcrumb-navigation
{% endcomment %}

{% unless template == 'index' or template contains 'product' %}
{%- comment -%}
  Game logo banners (owner, 2026-09-25: "can you add these as headers replacing
  that rainbow header at the top for the sections"): the Warhammer collections
  show their game's logo (Shopify Files) on a dark backdrop instead of the
  rainbow image and the title text. The title stays as the logo's alt text.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign xg_bc_logo = '' -%}
{%- assign xg_bc_key = collection.handle -%}
{%- comment -%} the search app's collection pages (/a/search/<handle>) carry no collection object {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if xg_bc_key == blank and request.path contains '/a/search/' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_key = request.path | split: '/' | last -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- case xg_bc_key -%}
  {%- when 'all-warhammer-40-000' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Warhammer-logo.png' -%}
  {%- when 'all-warhammer-age-of-sigmar' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'warhammeraos.png' -%}
  {%- when 'all-warhammer-kill-team' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'killteam-logo.png' -%}
  {%- when 'all-warhammer-the-horus-heresy' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'warhammer_thehorusheresy.png' -%}
  {%- when 'all-warhammer-the-old-world' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'ToW_Logo.png' -%}
  {%- when 'all-necromunda' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'necromunda-logo.png' -%}
  {%- when 'all-blood-bowl' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Bloodbowl_logo.png' -%}
  {%- when 'all-legions-imperialis' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'legions-imperialis-logo-2x.png' -%}
  {%- when 'all-middle-earth' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Middle-Earth_Strategy_Battle_Game_logo.webp' -%}
  {%- when 'all-bolt-action' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Bolt-Action-final-600x283.png' -%}
  {%- when 'battletech-miniatures-and-accessories' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'BattleTech_2018.webp' -%}
  {%- when 'all-ak-interactive' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'blanco_logo-02-copia.png' -%}
  {%- when 'citadel-collection' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'DgX8B69wOApRYTQ2-300x130.png' -%}
  {%- when 'all-battle-systems' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'battle-systems_1200x1200_57d44751-bbb7-4aa7-a4fe-a39d6ca47b90.webp' -%}
  {%- when 'all-the-army-painter' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Asset-1.png' -%}
  {%- when 'all-vallejo' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'logo_blanc.png' -%}
{%- endcase -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Gunpla (owner, 2026-09-29, after uploading the grade logos to Shopify Files: "add it to the
  header where we added warhammer logos ... for the different gunpla kits? each should get the
  gunpla logo too"): the Gunpla mark on every kit collection, the grade's own logo beside it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign xg_bc_logo2 = '' -%}
{%- case xg_bc_key -%}
  {%- when 'all-gunpla' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Gunpla_Logo_svg.webp' -%}
  {%- when 'gunpla-high-grade-hg' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Gunpla_Logo_svg.webp' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo2 = 'HG_Logo.webp' -%}
  {%- when 'gunpla-real-grade-rg' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Gunpla_Logo_svg.webp' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo2 = 'RGlogonew.webp' -%}
  {%- when 'gunpla-master-grade-mg' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Gunpla_Logo_svg.webp' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo2 = 'MGlogo.webp' -%}
  {%- when 'gunpla-perfect-grade-pg' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Gunpla_Logo_svg.webp' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo2 = 'pg.webp' -%}
{%- endcase -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Card games (owner, 2026-09-29: "possible to do these for pokemon, etc?" then the logos in Shopify
  Files): the game's logo on every collection whose handle names it - singles, sealed, boxes,
  decks, the whole catalogue and the search app's /a/search/<handle> pages. One Piece's manga and
  model-kit collections are not the card game. Star Wars: Unlimited and Flesh and Blood wait for
  their logos.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if xg_bc_logo == '' -%}
  {%- if xg_bc_key contains 'pokemon' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'International_Pokemon_logo_svg.webp' -%}
  {%- elsif xg_bc_key contains 'magic' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'b9165f_c51286b95d00424bbd601e58f49cfe4a_mv2.png' -%}
  {%- elsif xg_bc_key contains 'yu-gi-oh' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Yugioh_tcg_logo_2011_thumb_2f81b115-4c63-4846-9f6c-39bd883654ce.webp' -%}
  {%- elsif xg_bc_key contains 'lorcana' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Disney_Lorcana_Logo.png' -%}
  {%- elsif xg_bc_key contains 'riftbound' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = '639px-Riftbound_logo.png' -%}
  {%- elsif xg_bc_key contains 'neopets' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'left-logo-battledome.png' -%}
  {%- elsif xg_bc_key contains 'one-piece' -%}
    {%- unless xg_bc_key contains 'manga' or xg_bc_key contains 'model' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'One_Piece_logo.png' -%}{%- endunless -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%} every Army Painter line (the-army-painter-warpaints, ...) and Vallejo line (vallejo-game-color, ...) {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if xg_bc_logo == '' -%}
  {%- assign xg_bc_head = xg_bc_key | slice: 0, 17 -%}
  {%- if xg_bc_head == 'the-army-painter-' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'Asset-1.png' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign xg_bc_head = xg_bc_key | slice: 0, 8 -%}
  {%- if xg_bc_head == 'vallejo-' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'logo_blanc.png' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%} Warhammer Colour logo on every Citadel paint line (citadel-base-paints, citadel-contrast-paints, ...) {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign xg_bc_head = xg_bc_key | slice: 0, 8 -%}
{%- if xg_bc_logo == '' and xg_bc_head == 'citadel-' and xg_bc_key contains '-paints' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = 'DgX8B69wOApRYTQ2-300x130.png' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Shop by army (owner, 2026-09-28: "Is there a way for us to filter warhammer by army type?" ->
  a collection per army): army-<label> smart collections match the exor.army product field,
  which the worker's nightly run writes from the title (chaywrite src/army.js - the labels
  below must match its ARMIES labels exactly). The game pages list their armies as chips; an
  army page shows its game's logo, the army name and the same chips with the army marked.
  Only armies with products show.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign xg_armies_40k = "Space Marines|Black Templars|Blood Angels|Dark Angels|Space Wolves|Deathwatch|Grey Knights|Adepta Sororitas|Adeptus Custodes|Adeptus Mechanicus|Astra Militarum|Imperial Knights|Agents of the Imperium|Chaos Space Marines|Chaos Knights|Chaos Daemons|Death Guard|Thousand Sons|World Eaters|Emperor's Children|Aeldari|Drukhari|Genestealer Cults|Leagues of Votann|Necrons|Orks|T'au Empire|Tyranids" | split: '|' | sort -%}
{%- assign xg_armies_aos = "Stormcast Eternals|Cities of Sigmar|Fyreslayers|Kharadron Overlords|Lumineth Realm-lords|Idoneth Deepkin|Daughters of Khaine|Sylvaneth|Seraphon|Blades of Khorne|Disciples of Tzeentch|Maggotkin of Nurgle|Hedonites of Slaanesh|Slaves to Darkness|Skaven|Helsmiths of Hashut|Beasts of Chaos|Flesh-eater Courts|Nighthaunt|Ossiarch Bonereapers|Soulblight Gravelords|Orruk Warclans|Gloomspite Gitz|Ogor Mawtribes|Sons of Behemat" | split: '|' | sort -%}
{%- assign xg_armies_hh = "Legiones Astartes|Solar Auxilia|Mechanicum" | split: '|' -%}
{%- assign xg_armies_tow = "Kingdom of Bretonnia|Tomb Kings of Khemri|Empire of Man|Orc & Goblin Tribes|Dwarfen Mountain Holds|High Elf Realms|Wood Elf Realms|Warriors of Chaos|Beastmen Brayherds|Grand Cathay" | split: '|' | sort -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Army icons (owner, 2026-09-28: "include this logo nicely ... for each faction/army for 40k"):
  the owner's uploads in Shopify Files, army-<handle>.svg - single-colour silhouettes, drawn as a
  CSS mask so they take the text colour (white on the banner, dark on the current chip). Add a
  handle here when its file is uploaded (Adeptus Custodes and Chaos Knights have none yet).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign xg_army_icons = "|army-adepta-sororitas|army-adeptus-mechanicus|army-aeldari|army-agents-of-the-imperium|army-astra-militarum|army-black-templars|army-blood-angels|army-chaos-daemons|army-chaos-space-marines|army-dark-angels|army-death-guard|army-deathwatch|army-drukhari|army-emperors-children|army-genestealer-cults|army-grey-knights|army-imperial-knights|army-leagues-of-votann|army-necrons|army-orks|army-space-marines|army-space-wolves|army-tau-empire|army-thousand-sons|army-tyranids|army-world-eaters|" -%}
{%- assign xg_army_game = '' -%}
{%- assign xg_army_cur = '' -%}
{%- case xg_bc_key -%}
  {%- when 'all-warhammer-40-000', 'all-warhammer-kill-team' -%}{%- assign xg_army_game = '40k' -%}
  {%- when 'all-warhammer-age-of-sigmar' -%}{%- assign xg_army_game = 'aos' -%}
  {%- when 'all-warhammer-the-horus-heresy' -%}{%- assign xg_army_game = 'hh' -%}
  {%- when 'all-warhammer-the-old-world' -%}{%- assign xg_army_game = 'tow' -%}
{%- endcase -%}
{%- assign xg_bc_head = xg_bc_key | slice: 0, 5 -%}
{%- if xg_bc_head == 'army-' -%}
  {%- assign xg_army_needle = xg_bc_key | prepend: '|' | append: '|' -%}
  {%- capture xg_army_hs -%}{%- for a in xg_armies_40k -%}|{{ a | handleize | prepend: 'army-' }}{%- endfor -%}|{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- if xg_army_hs contains xg_army_needle -%}{%- assign xg_army_game = '40k' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- capture xg_army_hs -%}{%- for a in xg_armies_aos -%}|{{ a | handleize | prepend: 'army-' }}{%- endfor -%}|{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- if xg_army_hs contains xg_army_needle -%}{%- assign xg_army_game = 'aos' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- capture xg_army_hs -%}{%- for a in xg_armies_hh -%}|{{ a | handleize | prepend: 'army-' }}{%- endfor -%}|{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- if xg_army_hs contains xg_army_needle -%}{%- assign xg_army_game = 'hh' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- capture xg_army_hs -%}{%- for a in xg_armies_tow -%}|{{ a | handleize | prepend: 'army-' }}{%- endfor -%}|{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- if xg_army_hs contains xg_army_needle -%}{%- assign xg_army_game = 'tow' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- if xg_army_game != '' -%}
    {%- assign xg_army_cur = xg_bc_key -%}
    {%- assign xg_army_name = collections[xg_bc_key].title | default: collection.title -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- case xg_army_game -%}
  {%- when '40k' -%}{%- assign xg_army_list = xg_armies_40k -%}{%- assign xg_army_home = 'all-warhammer-40-000' -%}{%- assign xg_army_gname = 'Warhammer 40,000' -%}{%- assign xg_army_logo = 'Warhammer-logo.png' -%}
  {%- when 'aos' -%}{%- assign xg_army_list = xg_armies_aos -%}{%- assign xg_army_home = 'all-warhammer-age-of-sigmar' -%}{%- assign xg_army_gname = 'Warhammer Age of Sigmar' -%}{%- assign xg_army_logo = 'warhammeraos.png' -%}
  {%- when 'hh' -%}{%- assign xg_army_list = xg_armies_hh -%}{%- assign xg_army_home = 'all-warhammer-the-horus-heresy' -%}{%- assign xg_army_gname = 'The Horus Heresy' -%}{%- assign xg_army_logo = 'warhammer_thehorusheresy.png' -%}
  {%- when 'tow' -%}{%- assign xg_army_list = xg_armies_tow -%}{%- assign xg_army_home = 'all-warhammer-the-old-world' -%}{%- assign xg_army_gname = 'Warhammer: The Old World' -%}{%- assign xg_army_logo = 'ToW_Logo.png' -%}
{%- endcase -%}
{%- if xg_army_cur != '' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = xg_army_logo -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign xg_army_chips = '' -%}
{%- if xg_army_game != '' and template.suffix != 'paints' -%}
  {%- capture xg_army_chips -%}
    {%- for a in xg_army_list -%}
      {%- assign xg_ah = a | handleize | prepend: 'army-' -%}
      {%- assign xg_an = collections[xg_ah].products_count | default: 0 -%}
      {%- if xg_an > 0 or xg_ah == xg_army_cur -%}
      {%- assign xg_ai = xg_ah | prepend: '|' | append: '|' -%}
      <a class="xg-bc__army-chip" href="/collections/{{ xg_ah }}"{% if xg_ah == xg_army_cur %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{% if xg_army_icons contains xg_ai %}<span class="xg-bc__army-ico" style="--xg-ico:url({{ xg_ah | append: '.svg' | file_url }})" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}{{ a | escape }}{% if xg_an > 0 %}<small>{{ xg_an }}</small>{% endif %}</a>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign xg_army_chips = xg_army_chips | strip -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Shop by type (owner, 2026-09-30: "add filters to board games like we did with warhammer"):
  board-games-<type> smart collections match the bg:<label> product tags the worker's nightly
  run writes from the BoardGameGeek facts and the title (chaywrite src/bgtype.js - the labels
  below must match its BG_TYPES labels exactly; handles are `handleize` of the label). The
  Board Games page lists the types as chips; a type page shows the same chips with its own
  marked and an "All Board Games" chip. Only types with products show.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign xg_bg_types = "Party Games|Family & Kids|Strategy|Card Games|Co-op|2-Player|Solo Friendly|Dice Games|Deduction & Bluffing|Puzzles & Escape Rooms|Chess & Classics|Trivia & Word|Expansions" | split: '|' -%}
{%- assign xg_bg_cur = '' -%}
{%- assign xg_bg_on = false -%}
{%- if xg_bc_key == 'board-games' -%}{%- assign xg_bg_on = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- capture xg_bg_hs -%}{%- for a in xg_bg_types -%}|{{ a | handleize | prepend: 'board-games-' }}{%- endfor -%}|{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign xg_bg_needle = xg_bc_key | prepend: '|' | append: '|' -%}
{%- if xg_bg_hs contains xg_bg_needle -%}{%- assign xg_bg_on = true -%}{%- assign xg_bg_cur = xg_bc_key -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign xg_bg_chips = '' -%}
{%- if xg_bg_on -%}
  {%- capture xg_bg_chips -%}
    {%- for a in xg_bg_types -%}
      {%- assign xg_bh = a | handleize | prepend: 'board-games-' -%}
      {%- assign xg_bn = collections[xg_bh].products_count | default: 0 -%}
      {%- if xg_bn > 0 or xg_bh == xg_bg_cur -%}
      <a class="xg-bc__army-chip" href="/collections/{{ xg_bh }}"{% if xg_bh == xg_bg_cur %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ a | escape }}{% if xg_bn > 0 %}<small>{{ xg_bn }}</small>{% endif %}</a>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign xg_bg_chips = xg_bg_chips | strip -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Figures (owner, 2026-09-30: "make a filtering system for them"): "Shop by series" and
  "Shop by line" rows on All Figures / All Blind Box / Funko and on every series or line
  page. The labels below must match chaywrite src/figtype.js FRANCHISES / LINES (the
  nightly figtype phase tags products fig:<series> / figline:<line>); the collections
  are figures-<handleized label> and figure-line-<handleized label>. Only labels whose
  collection has products show.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign xg_fig_series = "One Piece|Dragon Ball|Demon Slayer|Naruto|Jujutsu Kaisen|My Hero Academia|Chainsaw Man|Spy x Family|Hatsune Miku|Pokemon|Sailor Moon|Frieren|Attack on Titan|Hunter x Hunter|JoJo's Bizarre Adventure|Evangelion|Gundam|Star Wars|Marvel|DC Comics|Warhammer 40K|Digimon|Yu-Gi-Oh!|Kirby|The Legend of Zelda|Sonic the Hedgehog|Street Fighter|Final Fantasy|Persona|Re:Zero|Overlord|Berserk|Transformers|Godzilla|Haikyu!!|Disney|Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles|Power Rangers|Tokyo Revengers|Elden Ring" | split: '|' -%}
{%- assign xg_fig_lines = "Nendoroid|Pop Up Parade|figma|S.H.Figuarts|FiguartsZERO|Ichibansho|Banpresto|SEGA Prize|FuRyu|Taito|Funko Pop!|JoyToy|ARTFX|MegaHouse|Good Smile|Bandai Spirits|Shokugan|Scale figures|Blind box|Statues & busts|Plush" | split: '|' -%}
{%- assign xg_fig_on = false -%}
{%- assign xg_fig_cur = '' -%}
{%- assign xg_fig_home = 'all-figures' -%}
{%- if xg_bc_key == 'all-figures' or xg_bc_key == 'all-blind-box' or xg_bc_key == 'funko-pops' -%}{%- assign xg_fig_on = true -%}{%- assign xg_fig_home = xg_bc_key -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- capture xg_fig_hs -%}{%- for a in xg_fig_series -%}|{{ a | handleize | prepend: 'figures-' }}{%- endfor -%}{%- for a in xg_fig_lines -%}|{{ a | handleize | prepend: 'figure-line-' }}{%- endfor -%}|{%- endcapture -%}
{%- if xg_fig_hs contains xg_bg_needle -%}{%- assign xg_fig_on = true -%}{%- assign xg_fig_cur = xg_bc_key -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign xg_fig_chips = '' -%}
{%- assign xg_figl_chips = '' -%}
{%- if xg_fig_on -%}
  {%- capture xg_fig_chips -%}
    {%- for a in xg_fig_series -%}
      {%- assign xg_fh = a | handleize | prepend: 'figures-' -%}
      {%- assign xg_fn = collections[xg_fh].products_count | default: 0 -%}
      {%- if xg_fn > 0 or xg_fh == xg_fig_cur -%}
      <a class="xg-bc__army-chip" href="/collections/{{ xg_fh }}"{% if xg_fh == xg_fig_cur %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ a | escape }}{% if xg_fn > 0 %}<small>{{ xg_fn }}</small>{% endif %}</a>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign xg_fig_chips = xg_fig_chips | strip -%}
  {%- capture xg_figl_chips -%}
    {%- for a in xg_fig_lines -%}
      {%- assign xg_fh = a | handleize | prepend: 'figure-line-' -%}
      {%- assign xg_fn = collections[xg_fh].products_count | default: 0 -%}
      {%- if xg_fn > 0 or xg_fh == xg_fig_cur -%}
      <a class="xg-bc__army-chip" href="/collections/{{ xg_fh }}"{% if xg_fh == xg_fig_cur %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ a | escape }}{% if xg_fn > 0 %}<small>{{ xg_fn }}</small>{% endif %}</a>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign xg_figl_chips = xg_figl_chips | strip -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}
  The colour picker view (?view=paints) covers every paint brand, so it gets its own banner
  instead of the logo of whichever collection it was opened from (owner, 2026-09-25: the
  Vallejo logo + "All Vallejo" crumb over the picker "is not proper anymore with other
  brands"): a title, the three brand logos (each switches the picker's brand tab; the picker
  marks the one showing) and a "Shop by colour" crumb.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign xg_bc_paints = false -%}
{%- if template.suffix == 'paints' -%}{%- assign xg_bc_paints = true -%}{%- assign xg_bc_logo = '' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if xg_bc_logo != '' or xg_bc_paints or xg_bg_on or xg_fig_on -%}
<style>
  .breadcrumb-container.xg-bc--logo { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 45%, #2b3137 0%, #171b1f 55%, #0e1113 100%) !important; }
  .xg-bc--logo .head-title.xg-bc__logo { margin: 0 0 6px; line-height: 0; }
  .xg-bc--logo .xg-bc__logo img { display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: auto; height: auto; max-width: min(460px, 90%); max-height: 110px; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, .55)); }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .xg-bc--logo .xg-bc__logo img { max-height: 72px; } }
  /* Gunpla: the Gunpla mark and the grade's logo side by side */
  .xg-bc--logo .head-title.xg-bc__logo--pair { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 30px; }
  .xg-bc--logo .xg-bc__logo--pair img { margin: 0; max-width: min(330px, 48%); max-height: 86px; }
  .xg-bc--logo .xg-bc__logo--pair img.xg-bc__logo2 { max-width: min(250px, 38%); max-height: 100px; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .xg-bc--logo .head-title.xg-bc__logo--pair { gap: 16px; } .xg-bc--logo .xg-bc__logo--pair img { max-height: 54px; } .xg-bc--logo .xg-bc__logo--pair img.xg-bc__logo2 { max-height: 64px; } }
  .xg-bc__pp { display: inline-flex; align-self: center; flex: 0 0 auto; width: auto; max-width: max-content; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 2px 0 8px; padding: 8px 16px 8px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff; color: #14181b !important; font: 700 13px/1 var(--xg-font-body, sans-serif); letter-spacing: .02em; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
  .xg-bc__pp:hover { background: #d62c28; color: #fff !important; }
  .xg-bc__pp-dots { display: inline-flex; }
  .xg-bc__pp-dots i { width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: -4px; border: 2px solid #fff; }
  .xg-bc__pp-dots i:nth-child(1) { background: #b3261e; } .xg-bc__pp-dots i:nth-child(2) { background: #e8a317; }
  .xg-bc__pp-dots i:nth-child(3) { background: #2f8f5b; } .xg-bc__pp-dots i:nth-child(4) { background: #2d5fae; margin-right: 0; }
  /* the Magic logo file is 828x465 with the mark in a band across the middle: the same treatment as Warhammer's */
  .xg-bc--logo .xg-bc__logo img[src*="b9165f_"] { max-width: min(520px, 96%); max-height: 175px; margin: -30px auto -28px; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .xg-bc--logo .xg-bc__logo img[src*="b9165f_"] { max-height: 115px; margin: -20px auto -18px; } }
  /* Warhammer-logo.png is 1400x900 with the mark in a band across the middle: larger box, pulled in by negative margins */
  .xg-bc--logo .xg-bc__logo img[src*="Warhammer-logo"] { max-width: min(560px, 96%); max-height: 230px; margin: -55px auto -50px; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .xg-bc--logo .xg-bc__logo img[src*="Warhammer-logo"] { max-height: 150px; margin: -36px auto -32px; } }
  .xg-bc--logo .head-title.xg-bc__ptitle { color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .xg-bc__brands { display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 0 auto 10px; width: max-content; max-width: 100%; }
