    <span>{{ collection.title | remove: ' Canada' }}</span>
    {% endif %}
    {% elsif template == 'article' %}
    <span class="divider">&dash;</span>
    {{ blog.title | link_to: blog.url }}
    <span class="divider">&dash;</span>
    <span>{{ article.title }}</span>

    {% elsif template contains 'page' %}
    <span class="divider"></span>


    {% else %}
    {%- comment -%}
      Search results (the search app's /a/search proxy page included) have no
      title of their own: page_title is the shop name there, so this crumb
